<title>FRANCE: Rouen March 1-19 grain exports 625,800 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen March 1-19 grain exports 625,800 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 625,800 tonnes between March 1 and March 19, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 345,000 tonnes for the whole of March 1996.</p>
<p>The 625,800 tonnes total included 497,267 tonnes of wheat and 128,533 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes) --</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		   51,590</p>
<p>    Algeria			 72,930</p>
<p>    Canary Islands		14,700</p>
<p>    Cuba			    11,057</p>
<p>    Egypt			   75,135</p>
<p>    Eritrea			 15,000</p>
<p>    Britain			  8,245</p>
<p>    Iraq			    73,260</p>
<p>    Ireland			  1,500</p>
<p>    Italy			   71,900</p>
<p>    Mozambique		    24,200</p>
<p>    Poland			  19,500</p>
<p>    Portugal			 3,070</p>
<p>    Tunisia			 27,500</p>
<p>    Turkey			  27,680</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    South Africa		  16,000</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		 112,533</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
